5. Provided mock session data for SessionProvider
6. Simplified the provider structure
7. Added better i18next initialization
8. Added error boundaries and fallbacks
9. Configured QueryClient with default options to prevent unnecessary requests

The changes focus on:
- Reducing dependencies that might cause import issues
